{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Twisted gl(4) L=2 Baxter solver — `[S,S,0,0] x [P,P,0,0]`\n\nSelf-contained, **functional only**: no Gelfand–Tsetlin patterns, no monodromy matrices, no\neigensystems. Everything is a polynomial identity in the spectral parameter `u`.\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Two sites, inhomogeneities `θ1, θ2`; shift `h`; site reps `λ1 = {S,S,0,0}`, `λ2 = {P,P,0,0}`.\n- Diagonal twist eigenvalues `z[j]`, `j = 1..4`. The exponential form is `z[j] = Exp[h φ[j]]`,\n  so that\n\n  $$ Q_j(u) \\;=\\; z_j^{u/h}\\, q_j(u) \\;=\\; e^{\\varphi_j u}\\, q_j(u), \\qquad \\deg q_j = M_j .$$\n\n  `z[j]` is kept as the primary symbol (everything is *rational* in `z`); `φ[j]` enters only via\n  the substitution `zφ` below, which is what the later perturbative-in-twist stage will use.\n- `χ[a]` = elementary symmetric polynomials of `z[1..4]`; the twist characteristic polynomial is\n  `z^4 - χ1 z^3 + χ2 z^2 - χ3 z + χ4`, whose roots are the `z[j]`.\n- A state is labelled by its gl(4) weight `μ = {μ1,μ2,μ3,μ4}` (for a highest-weight state, the\n  irrep in `[S,S,0,0] ⊗ [P,P,0,0]`). Degrees: `M_k = S + P - μ_k`, `Σ M_k = 2(S+P)`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Twist and Yangian weights",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Twist. z[j] are the four diagonal twist eigenvalues (primary symbols); φ[j] is the exponential\n   parametrisation z[j]=Exp[h φ[j]], used only via the substitution rules zφ / φz. χ[a] are the\n   elementary symmetric polynomials, so the z[j] are the roots of\n   z^4 - χ[1] z^3 + χ[2] z^2 - χ[3] z + χ[4]. *)\nClearAll[z, φ, χ, zvars, zφ, φz];\nzvars = Table[z[j], {j, 4}];\nχ[a_] := χ[a] = Total[(Times @@ #) & /@ Subsets[zvars, {a}]];\nzφ = Table[z[j] -> Exp[h φ[j]], {j, 4}];\nφz = Table[φ[j] -> Log[z[j]]/h, {j, 4}];\n\nTable[χ[a], {a, 4}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961315\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"6\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[6]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0e