  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Transfer matrices\n\n`τ_a(u)` has degree `2a` with leading coefficient `χ_a`. Two structural facts cut the number of\nfree coefficients from 12 to **5**.\n\n**(a) Subleading coefficient, fixed by the global Cartan weight.**\nWith `T_ii(u) = u^2 - u(θ1+θ2+h n_i) + …` and\n`τ_a = Σ_{|I|=a} z_I ∏_k T_{i_k i_k}(u-(a-k)h) + O(u^{2a-2})`,\n\n$$ [u^{2a-1}]\\,\\tau_a \\;=\\; -a\\big(\\theta_1+\\theta_2+(a-1)h\\big)\\chi_a \\;-\\; h\\,\\Xi_a,\n\\qquad \\Xi_a=\\sum_{|I|=a} z_I \\sum_{i\\in I} n_i .$$\n\n`n = μ` is the global weight, so this is fixed by the quantum numbers.\n\n**(b) `τ_3` factorises.** Because `ν_1=ν_2` and `ν_3=ν_4` for rectangular reps, every term of\n`τ_3 = Σ_{i<j<k} z_iz_jz_k \\,ν_i(u-2h)ν_j(u-h)ν_k(u)` shares the factor `ν_1(u-2h) ν_4(u)`:\n\n$$ \\tau_3(u) \\;=\\; \\nu_1(u-2h)\\,\\nu_4(u)\\,\\big(\\chi_3 u^2 + \\beta u + \\gamma\\big), $$\n\nwith `β` then fixed by (a). Untwisted this reproduces the `trivfactor` of `baxter_SU4_L2_XXX.wb`.\n\nFree unknowns: `tc[1]` (in `τ_1`), `tc[2],tc[3],tc[4]` (in `τ_2`), `tc[5] = γ` (in `τ_3`).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Ξ[a,n] and the subleading coefficient of τ_a.\n   COMPACT FORM: Ξ_a is the Cartan-weight derivation acting on the twist character,\n        Ξ_a = Σ_i n_i z_i ∂χ_a/∂z_i  =:  D_n χ_a,\n   so the whole subleading coefficient is\n        [u^(2a-1)] τ_a  =  -a (θ1 + θ2 + (a-1) h) χ_a  -  h D_n χ_a,\n   i.e. a pure twist prefactor times χ_a, plus h times the weights acting on χ_a. Both forms are\n   checked below, for a = 0..4 (a=0 is τ_0 = 1, and must give 0; a=4 is the quantum determinant,\n   whose u^7 coefficient is independently known). *)\nClearAll[Ξ, subl, Dn];\nΞ[a_, n_List] := Total[((Times @@ (z /@ #)) Total[n[[#]]]) & /@ Subsets[Range[4], {a}]];\nsubl[a_, n_List] := -a (θ1 + θ2 + (a - 1) h) χ[a] - h Ξ[a, n];\nDn[a_, n_List] := Sum[n[[i]] z[i] D[χ[a], z[i]], {i, 4}];\n\nWith[{n = {m1, m2, m3, m4}},\n {\"Ξ_a = D_n χ_a, a=0..4\" -> Table[Simplify[Ξ[a, n] - Dn[a, n]], {a, 0, 4}],\n  \"a=0 subleading vanishes\" -> Simplify[subl[0, n]],\n  \"a=4 matches the known qdet u^7 coefficient\" ->\n   Simplify[Coefficient[Expand[qdet[S, P][u]], u, 7] - subl[4, n] /. m1 + m2 + m3 + m4 -> 2 S + 2 P]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961315\" data-output-id=\"3\" data-out-n=\"19\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[19]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.01em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.755em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.755em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ξ_a = D_n </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"mord\">_a, a=0..4</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.905em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">a=0 subleading vanishes</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">a=4 matches the known qdet u</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">7 coefficient</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.905em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[19]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{$\\Xi$\\_a = D\\_n $\\chi$\\_a, a=0..4}\\to \\left\\{0,0,0,0,0\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{a=0 subleading vanishes}\\to 0 \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{a=4 matches the known qdet u\\^{}7 coefficient} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 0\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "73a83b2e-92e5-41bb-92dd-835af4cc04f6"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
