  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Transfer-matrix ansatz. tc[1..5] are the only free coefficients. *)\nClearAll[τ, τ3quad, tc, tcvars];\ntcvars = Table[tc[i], {i, 5}];\n\nτ[1][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[1] u^2 + subl[1, μ] u + tc[1];\nτ[2][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[2] u^4 + subl[2, μ] u^3 + tc[2] u^2 + tc[3] u + tc[4];\n\n(* β fixed by matching the u^5 coefficient of the factorised form to subl[3,μ] *)\nτ3quad[S_, P_, μ_] := τ3quad[S, P, μ] = Module[{x, bb, expr},\n   expr = Expand[ν[S, P][1][x - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][x] (χ[3] x^2 + bb x + tc[5])];\n   Simplify[bb /. First@Solve[Coefficient[expr, x, 5] == subl[3, μ], bb]]];\n\nτ[3][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][u] (χ[3] u^2 + τ3quad[S, P, μ] u + tc[5]);\nτ[4][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := qdet[S, P][u];\n\nExpand[τ3quad[S, P, {m1, m2, m3, m4}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
