  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* HARD CHECK of both structural facts at once, on the pseudovacuum μ_top={S+P,S+P,0,0}, where the\n   exact eigenvalue is the elementary-symmetric expression in the shifted ν's (same index/shift\n   ordering as qdet). For a=1,2,3 the ansatz must match it IDENTICALLY in u once tc[..] is chosen\n   — i.e. every coefficient except the free ones must already agree. Any mismatch means the\n   subleading formula or the τ3 factorisation is wrong. *)\nClearAll[τvac];\nτvac[S_, P_][a_][u_] := Total[((Times @@ (z /@ #)) Product[ν[S, P][#[[k]]][u - (a - k) h], {k, a}]) & /@ Subsets[Range[4], {a}]];\n\nModule[{μtop = {S + P, S + P, 0, 0}, x, diffs, sol},\n  diffs = Table[Expand[τ[a][S, P, μtop][x] - τvac[S, P][a][x]], {a, 1, 3}];\n  sol = Solve[Thread[Flatten[CoefficientList[diffs, x]] == 0], tcvars];\n  If[sol === {}, Print[\"FAIL: ansatz cannot reproduce the pseudovacuum\"],\n   Print[\"pseudovacuum residual after solving for tc: \",\n    Simplify[diffs /. First[sol]]];\n   Print[\"tc at the pseudovacuum: \", Simplify[tcvars /. First[sol]]]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
