"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:33.6929em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: pseudovacuum residual after solving for tc:[formula]tc at the pseudovacuum:[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d5d69561-1cab-452b-8eee-b6d4b0efc527"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. The Baxter (TQ) equation\n\n$$ Q(u+h) - \\frac{\\tau_1}{\\nu_1(u)}Q(u) + \\frac{\\tau_2}{\\nu_1(u)\\nu_1(u-h)}Q(u-h)\n - \\frac{\\tau_3}{\\nu_1(u)\\nu_1(u-h)\\nu_1(u-2h)}Q(u-2h)\n + \\frac{\\tau_4}{\\nu_1(u)\\nu_1(u-h)\\nu_1(u-2h)\\nu_1(u-3h)}Q(u-3h) = 0 .$$\n\nSubstituting `Q_k(u) = z_k^{u/h} q_k(u)`, clearing the `ν_1` denominators and multiplying by\n`z_k^3` gives a purely polynomial residual `R_k(u)`, of degree `8 + M_k`:\n\n$$ R_k = z_k^4 N_0\\, q_k(u{+}h) - z_k^3 \\tau_1 N_1\\, q_k(u) + z_k^2 \\tau_2 N_2\\, q_k(u{-}h)\n - z_k \\tau_3 N_3\\, q_k(u{-}2h) + \\tau_4\\, q_k(u{-}3h),$$\n\n`N_m = ∏_{j=m}^{3} ν_1(u-jh)`. Its top coefficient is `z_k^4 - χ_1 z_k^3 + χ_2 z_k^2 - χ_3 z_k + χ_4`,\nwhich vanishes identically — and the *next* coefficient is what fixes `M_k = S+P-μ_k`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Degrees, monic ansatz, and the polynomial Baxter residual. *)\nClearAll[Mdeg, qc, qmonic, BaxRes];\nMdeg[S_, P_, μ_List] := (S + P) - μ;\n\n(* q_k monic of degree M, unknown coefficients qc[k,0..M-1] *)\nqmonic[k_, M_][x_] := x^M + Sum[qc[k, j] x^j, {j, 0, M - 1}];\n\nBaxRes[S_, P_, μ_][k_][qf_][x_] :=\n   z[k]^4 Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 0, 3}] qf[x + h]\n - z[k]^3 τ[1][S, P, μ][x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 1, 3}] qf[x]\n + z[k]^2 τ[2][S, P, μ][x] Product[ν1[S, P][x - m h], {m, 2, 3}] qf[x - h]\n - z[k]   τ[3][S, P, μ][x] ν1[S, P][x - 3 h] qf[x - 2 h]\n + τ[4][S, P, μ][x] qf[x - 3 h];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Structural check, symbolic in everything: for an ARBITRARY polynomial q of degree M the two\n   top coefficients of R_k are q-independent. The top one vanishes identically (charPoly[z_k]);\n   the next one vanishes precisely when M = S+P-μ_k, given the box count Σμ = 2(S+P).\n   So the degree formula is DERIVED here, not assumed. Done for branch 1 at M=12. *)\nModule[{μ = {m1, m2, m3, m4}, x, gq, R, M = 12, box},\n  gq[y_] := y^M + cM1 y^(M - 1) + cM2 y^(M - 2);\n  R = Expand[BaxRes[S, P, μ][1][gq][x]];\n  box = {m1 -> S + P - M, m4 -> 2 S + 2 P - (S + P - M) - m2 - m3};\n  {\"top coeff (any μ)\" -> Simplify[Coefficient[R, x, M + 8]],\n   \"next coeff, μ1 = S+P-M and Σμ = 2(S+P)\" -> Simplify[Coefficient[R, x, M + 7] /. box],\n   \"next coeff, μ1 generic (does NOT vanish)\" -> Simplify[Coefficient[R, x, M + 7] /. m4 -> 2 S + 2 P - m1 - m2 - m3]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"516305\" data-output-id=\"17\" data-out-n=\"34\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[34]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.5em;vertical-align:-3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4em;\"><span style=\"top:-6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">top coeff (any </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">next coeff, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 = S+P-M and Σ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"> = 2(S+P)</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">next coeff, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 generic (does NOT vanish)</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[34]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{top coeff (any $\\mu$)}\\to 0 \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{next coeff, $\\mu$1 = S+P-M and $\\Sigma$$\\mu$ = 2(S+P)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to 0,\\text{next coeff, $\\mu$1 generic (does NOT vanish)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to h\\,z\\left(1\\right)\\,\\left(z\\left(1\\right)-z\\left(2\\right)\\right)\\,\\left(z\\left(1\\right)-z\\left(3\\right)\\right)\\, \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left(z\\left(1\\right)-z\\left(4\\right)\\right)\\,\\left(m1-P-S+12\\right)\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "94cf9a68-a00a-48b8-92f7-f7f096b8ce06"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Solver\n\nUnknowns: the five `tc[i]` plus the subleading coefficients of the four monic `q_k` —\n`5 + Σ M_k = 5 + 2(S+P)` in all. Equations: every coefficient of `R_k(u)`, `k=1..4`, which is\n`Σ(7 + M_k) = 28 + 2(S+P)` conditions. Overdetermined by 23; the system is **bilinear**\n(`tc × qc`), which is what `Solve` handles here.\n\nOne branch is not enough: for `μ_top` at `(S,P)=(1,1)`, branch 1 alone leaves a 2-parameter\nfamily. All four together give a unique solution.\n\nThe number of solutions returned is the **weight multiplicity** of `μ` in `[S,S,0,0]⊗[P,P,0,0]`,\nnot 1 — the twisted spectrum has no su(4) symmetry, so every state of that weight has the same\n`M_k` and shows up here.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Tensor-product decomposition [S,S,0,0] x [P,P,0,0] via Schur polynomials\n   (copied verbatim from baxter_SU4_L2_XXX.wb -- self-contained notebook convention). *)\nClearAll[schur, tensorDecomp, dimGL4, irreps];\nschur[lam_, x_] := Cancel[Det[Table[x[[i]]^(lam[[j]] + Length[x] - j), {i, Length[x]}, {j, Length[x]}]]/Det[Table[x[[i]]^(Length[x] - j), {i, Length[x]}, {j, Length[x]}]]];\ntensorDecomp[lam_, mu_] := Module[{x = Array[xx, 4], prod, rules, nu, mult, out = {}},\n   prod = Expand[schur[lam, x] schur[mu, x]];\n   While[prod =!= 0, rules = Association[CoefficientRules[prod, x]]; nu = Last[Sort[Keys[rules]]];\n     mult = rules[nu]; AppendTo[out, nu -> mult]; prod = Expand[prod - mult schur[nu, x]]];\n   out];\ndimGL4[lam_] := Product[(lam[[i]] - lam[[j]] + j - i)/(j - i), {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\nirreps[S_, P_] := irreps[S, P] = tensorDecomp[{S, S, 0, 0}, {P, P, 0, 0}][[All, 1]];\n\nirreps[1, 1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
