   "value": "## 6. Wronskians and the twist normalisation\n\nFor `Q_j(u) = z_j^{u/h} q_j(u)` the `k x k` Casoratian factorises with the exponentials pulled out\ncompletely:\n\n$$ Q_{i_1\\dots i_k}(u)=\\det_{a,b}\\big[Q_{i_a}(u-(b-1)h)\\big]\n =\\Big(\\prod_{a} z_{i_a}\\Big)^{u/h}\\Big(\\prod_a z_{i_a}\\Big)^{-(k-1)} W_I(u), $$\n$$ W_I(u)=\\det_{a,b}\\big[\\,z_{i_a}^{\\,k-b}\\;q_{i_a}\\big(u-(b-1)h\\big)\\big] . $$\n\n`W_I` is a polynomial of degree `Sum_{i in I} M_i` whose leading coefficient is **exactly the\nVandermonde** `V_I = Prod_{a<a'}(z_{i_a} - z_{i_a'})` — immediate, since the `q`'s are monic, so the\ntop coefficient is `det[z_{i_a}^{k-b}]`.\n\n### The normalisation\n\n$$ Q_I(u) = N_I\\,\\Big(\\prod_{i\\in I} z_i\\Big)^{u/h} q_I(u),\\qquad\n N_I=\\frac{V_I}{\\big(\\prod_{i\\in I} z_i\\big)^{|I|-1}},\\qquad q_I=\\frac{W_I}{V_I} $$\n\nso `q_I` is **monic of degree `Sum_{i in I} M_i`**, and it is regular as the twist is switched off\nexactly when `I` is a *lower set* for the degrees `M` — the `|I|` branches with the smallest `M_i`\n(ties interchangeable). For a state that becomes highest weight on untwisting `M` is increasing, so\nthe regular chain is precisely `{1}` in `{1,2}` in `{1,2,3}` in `{1,2,3,4}`, i.e.\n`q_1, q_12, q_123, q_1234`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Casoratian machinery. Wronsk gives the polynomial part W_I; Vand the Vandermonde V_I;\n   qWronsk = W_I/V_I is the monic, regularity-adapted object. *)\nClearAll[Wronsk, Vand, qWronsk];\nWronsk[rec_, II_List][x_] := Module[{k = Length[II]},\n   Det[Table[z[II[[a]]]^(k - b) qpoly[rec[\"q\"][[II[[a]]]], x - (b - 1) h], {a, k}, {b, k}]]];\nVand[II_List] := Product[z[II[[a]]] - z[II[[b]]], {a, Length[II]}, {b, a + 1, Length[II]}];\nqWronsk[rec_, II_List][x_] := Cancel[Together[Wronsk[rec, II][x]/Vand[II]]];\n\n(* leading coefficient of W_I is V_I, and deg W_I = Sum_{i in I} M_i — checked on a vacuum state *)\nModule[{r = First[TwistedSolve[2, 1, {3, 3, 0, 0}, num]], x, W},\n  Table[W = Expand[Together[Wronsk[r, II][x] /. num]];\n   {II, Total[r[\"M\"][[II]]], Exponent[W, x], Simplify[Coefficient[W, x, Exponent[W, x]] - (Vand[II] /. num)]},\n   {II, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 3, 4}}}] // TableForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"516305\" data-output-id=\"27\" data-out-n=\"77\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"23\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[77]//TableForm=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue3BtYXRyaXh9XGxlZnRcezEsMlxyaWdodFx9ICYgMCAmIDAgJiAwXFxcbGVmdFx7MSwzXHJpZ2h0XH0gJiAzICYgMyAmIDBcXFxsZWZ0XHsxLDIsM1xyaWdodFx9ICYgMyAmIDMgJiAwXFxcbGVmdFx7MiwzLDRccmlnaHRcfSAmIDYgJiA2ICYgMFxcXGxlZnRcezEsMiwzLDRccmlnaHRcfSAmIDYgJiA2ICYgMFxlbmR7cG1hdHJpeH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:6.000em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"6.000em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 6000\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,2484c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-2492c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,155.3,-396.3,270,-559c6