  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### The top Casoratian in closed form\n\nReplacing the first column of `C(u+h) = det[Q_a(u+h-(b-1)h)]` by the TQ equation kills all but the\nlast term, giving `C(u+h) = A_4(u) C(u)` with `A_4 = tau_4 / (nu_1(u) nu_1(u-h) nu_1(u-2h) nu_1(u-3h))`.\nBecause `nu_2 = nu_1` and `nu_3 = nu_4` for rectangular reps this collapses to\n\n$$ \\frac{W(u+h)}{W(u)}=\\frac{\\nu_4(u)\\,\\nu_4(u-h)}{\\nu_1(u)\\,\\nu_1(u-h)},$$\n\nwhich telescopes. With\n\n$$ A(u)=\\prod_{j=1}^{S}(u-\\theta_1-jh)\\prod_{j=1}^{P}(u-\\theta_2-jh),\\qquad \\frac{A(u+h)}{A(u)}=\\frac{\\nu_4(u)}{\\nu_1(u)},$$\n\nthe solution is `W_{1234}(u) = V_{1234} A(u) A(u-h)`, of degree `2(S+P) = Sum M_k` as required.\nSo `q_{1234} = A(u)A(u-h)` is completely explicit: **independent of the state and of the twist**.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[AA];\nAA[SS_, PP_][x_] := Product[x - θ1 - j h, {j, SS}] Product[x - θ2 - j h, {j, PP}];\n\n(* W_1234 = V_1234 A(u) A(u-h), exactly, for every (S,P) and every state. *)\nModule[{x},\n Grid[Prepend[\n   Flatten[Table[\n     Table[With[{r = First[TwistedSolve[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], w, num]]},\n       {sp, w, Simplify[Cancel[Together[Wronsk[r, {1, 2, 3, 4}][x] /. num]] -\n          Cancel[Together[Vand[{1, 2, 3, 4}] AA[sp[[1]], sp[[2]]][x] AA[sp[[1]], sp[[2]]][x - h] /. num]]]}],\n      {w, vacWeights[sp[[1]], sp[[2]]]}],\n     {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}], 1],\n   {\"(S,P)\", \"weight n\", \"W_1234 - V A(u)A(u-h)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"516305\" data-output-id=\"28\" data-out-n=\"80\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"12\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[80]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:22.84em;vertical-align:-11.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:11.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-13.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:22.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-11.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:11.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-13.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(S,P)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.41em;\"><