  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* State C: the singlet, (S,P)=(1,1) weight {1,1,1,1}, M = {1,1,1,1}. All degrees are equal, so no\n   branch has to drop degree and NOTHING diverges — the control case showing the divergence is\n   caused by M_k > M_1, not by the collision of the twists per se. Selected by its untwisted\n   degree spectrum {1,2,3,4}. *)\nModule[{sols, sel},\n  sols = TwistedSolve[1, 1, {1, 1, 1, 1}, eps1];\n  sel = Select[sols, degMonic[1, 1, {1, 1, 1, 1}, Simplify[Limit[#[\"tc\"], eps -> 0]], 6] === {1, 2, 3, 4} &];\n  Grid[ordReport[First[sel], eps1, {{1, 2}, {2, 3}, {3, 4}, {1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 3, 4}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"516305\" data-output-id=\"31\" data-out-n=\"92\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"30\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[92]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.24em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:13.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"