  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Coefficient magnitudes across three decades of eps. Expect: q_1,q_2 flat (M=1=M_1);\n   q_3,q_4 growing like eps^-2 = eps^-(M_k-M_1); q_12, q_123 flat; q_1234 flat and in fact equal\n   to the closed form A(u)A(u-h) EXACTLY (checked below).\n   NB the low coefficients of q_1234 read as 0 at small eps — that is precision loss (dividing by\n   V ~ eps^6), visible in their accuracy annotations, not a real vanishing. *)\nClearAll[scan31];\nscan31[e_] := Module[{sub, sols, tc0 = untw31[[2]], best, x},\n   sub = Join[{θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> 1/7, h -> 1}, Table[z[j] -> 1 + e psi[[j]], {j, 4}]];\n   sols = TwistedSolve[3, 1, {3, 3, 1, 1}, sub];\n   best = First@SortBy[sols, Norm[N[#[\"tc\"] - tc0, 40]] &];\n   <|\"eps\" -> e, \"sub\" -> sub, \"rec\" -> best, \"dist\" -> N[Norm[N[best[\"tc\"] - tc0, 40]], 5],\n     \"q\" -> Table[N[Abs[best[\"q\"][[k]]], 30], {k, 4}],\n     \"qI\" -> Table[N[Abs[CoefficientList[Collect[qWronsk[best, II][x] /. sub, x], x]], 30],\n                   {II, {{1, 2}, {1, 2, 3}, {1, 2, 3, 4}}}]|>];\n\nres31 = Table[scan31[e], {e, {1/100, 1/1000, 1/10000}}];\nGrid[Prepend[\n  Join[{{\"dist to tc0\", Sequence @@ res31[[All, \"dist\"]]}},\n   Table[{\"q_\" <> ToString[k], Sequence @@ Table[N[res31[[e]][\"q\"][[k]], 3], {e, 3}]}, {k, 4}],\n   Table[{ToString[{{1, 2}, {1, 2, 3}, {1, 2, 3, 4}}[[i]]], Sequence @@ Table[N[res31[[e]][\"qI\"][[i]], 3], {e, 3}]}, {i, 3}]],\n  {\"object\", \"eps=1e-2\", \"eps=1e-3\", \"eps=1e-4\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
