  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The reduced operator for k=3: O_3 = W_123 / V_12, a SECOND-ORDER difference operator in q_3,\n     O_3[f](u) = a1 f(u) - a2 f(u-h) + a3 f(u-2h),\n     a1 = z3^2 W_12(u-h)/V_12,  a2 = z3 M32(u)/V_12,  a3 = z1 z2 W_12(u)/V_12,\n   with M32(u) = z1^2 q_1(u) q_2(u-2h) - z2^2 q_2(u) q_1(u-2h) the (1,3) minor of rows 1,2.\n   Checks: (i) coefficients regular of degree M_1+M_2; (ii) at eps=0 the polynomial kernel is\n   exactly the untwisted span{P_1,P_2}, of degrees Mhat_1 = M_1 and Mhat_2 = M_2+1; (iii) away from\n   those two degrees, deg O_3[f] = M_1+M_2+d-2 -- which is the input to the count in the markdown.\n\n   TWO TRAPS, both hit while writing this:\n   - the spectral variable must be PASSED IN, not Module-localised inside redOp3, or the returned\n     expressions carry a scoped x$nnn and every coefficient silently reads as degree 0;\n   - Limit[] applied to the whole rational expression is unreliable on the algebraic (multiplicity>1)\n     states -- it returned different branches on repeated runs. Take the limit coefficient-by-\n     coefficient instead (lim0c). *)\nClearAll[redOp3, lim0c];\nredOp3[r_, sub_, x_] := Module[{W12, M32},\n   W12[y_] := Wronsk[r, {1, 2}][y];\n   M32[y_] := z[1]^2 qpoly[r[\"q\"][[1]], y] qpoly[r[\"q\"][[2]], y - 2 h] - z[2]^2 qpoly[r[\"q\"][[2]], y] qpoly[r[\"q\"][[1]], y - 2 h];\n   Cancel[Together[{z[3]^2 W12[x - h], z[3] M32[x], z[1] z[2] W12[x]}/Vand[{1, 2}] /. sub]]];\nlim0c[e_, x_] := Module[{cl = CoefficientList[Collect[Cancel[Together[e]], x], x]},\n   Simplify[Table[Limit[c, eps -> 0], {c, cl}]] . x^Range[0, Length[cl] - 1]];\n\nModule[{x, r = stateA, a, N0, Ms = stateA[\"M\"]},\n  a = (lim0c[#, x] &) /@ redOp3[r, eps1, x];\n  N0[f_] := Expand[a[[1]] f[x] - a[[2]] f[x - h] + a[[3]] f[x - 2 h] /. eps1];\n  Grid[{{\"M\", Ms}, {\"kernel degrees predicted (Mhat_1, Mhat_2)\", {Ms[[1]], Ms[[2]] + 1}},\n    {\"coefficient degrees (= M_1+M_2)\", Exponent[#, x] & /@ a},\n    {\"O_3[q_1] (must vanish)\", Simplify[N0[Function[y, qpoly[r[\"q\"][[1]], y]]]]},\n    {\"d -> deg O_3\", Table[d -> Exponent[N0[Function[y, Sum[gg[j] y^j, {j, 0, d}]]], x], {d, 0, 5}]},\n    {\"generic rule M_1+M_2+d-2\", Table[d -> Ms[[1]] + Ms[[2]] + d - 2, {d, 0, 5}]},\n    {\"=> extra drops exactly at d = 0, 2 = Mhat_1, Mhat_2\", \"kernel confirmed\"},\n    {\"count at d = M_3+2 (outside kernel)\", {Ms[[3]] + 2, \"deg\" -> Exponent[N0[Function[y, Sum[gg[j] y^j, {j, 0, Ms[[3]] + 2}]]], x], \"= M_1+M_2+M_3\" -> Total[Ms[[{1, 2, 3}]]]}}},\n   Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"516305\" data-output-id=\"37\" data-out-n=\"109\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"36\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[109]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"19\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.65em;vertical-align:-4.555em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.095em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.055em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.61em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.555em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.055em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">M</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.015em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kernel degrees predicted (Mhat_1, Mhat_2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coefficient degrees (= M_1+M_2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.615em;