  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Perturbation theory in the twist — first non-trivial order\n\nTwo changes from Section 6:\n\n- **Normalisation.** `q_k(u0) = 1` instead of monic. Under monic the coefficients diverge like `eps^(-(M_k-M_1))`; normalising at a point makes every coefficient *regular*, at the price of letting the **degree drop** in the limit (the leading coefficients switch off smoothly). `u0` is a parameter, default `0`.\n- **Twist.** `z_j = Exp[I eps psi_j]` — the genuine exponential, series-expanded to the same order as the solve, rather than the rational `z_j = 1 + eps psi_j` of Section 6.\n\nDegree bound is the staggered `Mhat_k = M_k + (k-1)`, so the same ansatz covers both the twisted degrees (`M_k`, top `k-1` coefficients must come out zero) and the untwisted ones.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Section 8 setup. psi are the twist rapidities; z_j = Exp[I eps psi_j] truncated at the\n   solve order, so the eps-grading below is exact to that order. *)\nClearAll[qnorm, zser, psi, u0, th, pv];\npsi = {1, 1/3, 1/5, 1/7};\nth  = {θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> 1/7, h -> 1};\nu0  = 0;\n\nzser[n_] := Table[z[j] -> Normal[Series[Exp[I eps psi[[j]]], {eps, 0, n}]], {j, 4}];\n\n(* Ansatz of degree D normalised at u0: the constant coefficient is eliminated, NOT the\n   leading one, so the degree is only an upper bound. *)\nqnorm[k_, D_][x_] := 1 + Table[qc[k, j], {j, D}] . (x^Range[D] - u0^Range[D]);\n\n{zser[1], qnorm[3, 4][x]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961315\" data-output-id=\"6\" data-out-n=\"51\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"38\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[51]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.9242em;vertical-align:-3.2121em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.7121em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.7121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.8979em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2121em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.7121em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.7121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"m