   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Order eps^0: all four twists collide, so the four Baxter equations degenerate to ONE\n   untwisted equation. Expect the transfer matrix to be fixed but the Q's not: the residual\n   freedom is the unipotent rotation q_k -> q_k + (lower branches), of dimension\n   Sum_k #{i<k : Mhat_i <= Mhat_k} = 0+1+2+3 = 6. *)\nunk0 = Table[pv[v, 0], {v, pert[\"unk\"]}];\nsol0 = Solve[Thread[Flatten[pert[\"eqs\"][[1]]] == 0], unk0];\nfree0 = Complement[unk0, First[sol0][[All, 1]]];\n{\"#solutions\" -> Length[sol0], \"#free parameters left\" -> Length[free0], \"free\" -> free0,\n \"tc at order 0\" -> (Table[pv[tc[i], 0], {i, 5}] /. First[sol0])}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre-wrap\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
