  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Casimirs and Q-degrees from the shifted weights. degU is exactly Mdeg + Range[0,3] = Mhat.\n   NB: every continued line below ends with its operator. Breaking a line where the expression\n   is already complete makes the front end start a NEW statement -- that silently dropped the\n   quadratic factor of tau3 and the Cas4 term of tau2 on the first attempt. *)\nClearAll[muhatU, xwU, PwU, Cas2U, Cas4U, degU, mutopU];\nmuhatU[μ_] := Table[μ[[i]] + 4 - i, {i, 4}];\ndegU[μ_, SS_, PP_] := Table[(SS + PP + 3) - muhatU[μ][[k]], {k, 4}];\nxwU[μ_] := Table[μ[[i]] + 5/2 - i, {i, 4}];\nPwU[μ_, k_] := Total[xwU[μ]^k];\nCas2U[μ_] := PwU[μ, 2] - 5;\nCas4U[μ_] := PwU[μ, 4] + 4 PwU[μ, 3] - PwU[μ, 1] PwU[μ, 2] + PwU[μ, 2]/2 - 2 PwU[μ, 1]^2 - 10 PwU[μ, 1] - 51/4;\nmutopU = {S + P, S + P, 0, 0};\n\nClearAll[t1vacU, t2vacU, b2vacU, b2genU, b3genU, tau1U, tau2U, tau2cU, tau3U, tau4U];\nt1vacU[uu_] := Sum[nuU[i][uu], {i, 4}];\nt2vacU[uu_] := Sum[nuU[i][uu - h] nuU[j][uu], {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\nb2vacU = Simplify[Coefficient[Expand[t2vacU[u]], u, 2]];\nb2genU[μ_] := b2vacU + h^2 (Cas2U[μ] - Cas2U[mutopU]);\nb3genU[μ_] := (bU[3] /. asympSolU) /. bU[2] -> b2genU[μ];\n\ntau1U[μ_][uu_] := t1vacU[uu] + (h^2/2) (Cas2U[μ] - Cas2U[mutopU]);\ntau2U[μ_][uu_] := t2vacU[uu] + (h^2/8) (Cas2U[μ] - Cas2U[mutopU]) (t1vacU[uu] + t1vacU[uu - h]) + h^4 (1/8 (Cas2U[μ]^2 - Cas2U[mutopU]^2) - 1/4 (Cas4U[μ] - Cas4U[mutopU]));\ntau2cU[μ_, SS_, PP_][uu_] := (tau2U[μ][uu] /. {S -> SS, P -> PP}) + (h^4 (1 + 2 SS + 2 PP)/4) (Cas2U[μ] - Cas2U[{SS + PP, SS + PP, 0, 0}]);\ntau3U[μ_][uu_] := n3U[uu] (uu - θ1 - h (S + 2)) (uu - θ2 - h (P + 2)) (4 uu^2 - 4 uu (θ1 + θ2) + 4 θ1 θ2 - 2 h P uu - 2 h S uu - 8 h uu + b3genU[μ]);\ntau4U[uu_] := t4U[uu];\n\n(* Structural checks: degU == Mhat over all irreps, and the tau degrees must be 2,4,6,8. *)\n{\"degU == Mhat\" -> Table[Union[(degU[#, SS, PP] === Mdeg[SS, PP, #] + Range[0, 3] &) /@ irreps[SS, PP]], {SS, 3}, {PP, 2}],\n \"tau degrees\" -> {Exponent[Expand[tau1U[{2, 1, 1, 0}][u] /. {S -> 1, P -> 1}], u],\n                   Exponent[Expand[tau2cU[{2, 1, 1, 0}, 1, 1][u]], u],\n                   Exponent[Expand[tau3U[{2, 1, 1, 0}][u] /. {S -> 1, P -> 1}], u],\n                   Exponent[Expand[tau4U[u] /. {S -> 1, P -> 1}], u]},\n \"tau2 carries Cas4\" -> ! FreeQ[Simplify[tau2cU[{2, 1, 1, 0}, 1, 1][u] - tau2cU[{1, 1, 1, 1}, 1, 1][u]], u]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
