   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Untwisted Q-solver, ported. The four untwisted solutions have strictly increasing degrees\n   degU_k = (S+P) - mu_k + (k-1), so a lower-degree solution can always be added to a higher one;\n   that freedom is removed by forcing the coefficient of u^(degU_j) in q_k to vanish for j<k.\n   Returns monic ascending coefficient lists P_1..P_4. *)\nClearAll[QsolveU];\nQsolveU[μ_, SS_, PP_] := QsolveU[μ, SS, PP] = Module[{ds, t1, t2, t3, t4, n1},\n   ds = degU[μ, SS, PP];\n   t1[uu_] = tau1U[μ][uu] /. {S -> SS, P -> PP};\n   t2[uu_] = tau2cU[μ, SS, PP][uu];\n   t3[uu_] = tau3U[μ][uu] /. {S -> SS, P -> PP};\n   t4[uu_] = tau4U[uu] /. {S -> SS, P -> PP};\n   n1[uu_] = n1U[uu] /. {S -> SS, P -> PP};\n   Table[Module[{m = ds[[kk]], gauge = ds[[1 ;; kk - 1]], qq, cl, sol},\n       qq[uu_] := Sum[cq[j] uu^j, {j, 0, m}];\n       cl = CoefficientList[Expand[\n            qq[u + h] n1[u] n1[u - h] n1[u - 2 h] n1[u - 3 h]\n          - t1[u] qq[u] n1[u - h] n1[u - 2 h] n1[u - 3 h]\n          + t2[u] qq[u - h] n1[u - 2 h] n1[u - 3 h]\n          - t3[u] qq[u - 2 h] n1[u - 3 h]\n          + t4[u] qq[u - 3 h]], u];\n       sol = Solve[Join[Thread[cl == 0], {cq[m] == 1}, Thread[(cq /@ gauge) == 0]], Table[cq[j], {j, 0, m}]];\n       Table[cq[j], {j, 0, m}] /. First[sol]], {kk, 4}]];\n\n(* Acceptance: every P_k must solve the untwisted Baxter equation identically. Reuse this\n   notebook's own BaxRes at z->1 rather than the source notebook's, so this is a genuine\n   cross-check of the port against local conventions. *)\nClearAll[verifyU];\nverifyU[μ_, SS_, PP_] := Module[{ps = QsolveU[μ, SS, PP], x},\n   AllTrue[Range[4], Simplify[Expand[\n      BaxRes[SS, PP, μ][#][Function[y, qpoly[ps[[#]], y]]][x] /. Thread[tcvars -> tc0U[μ, SS, PP]] /. z1sub]] === 0 &]];\n\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[{{SS, PP}, μ, degU[μ, SS, PP], verifyU[μ, SS, PP]},\n     {SS, 2}, {PP, 2}, {μ, irreps[SS, PP]}], 2],\n   {\"(S,P)\", \"mu\", \"deg P_k\", \"all four solve untwisted Baxter?\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
