"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-20.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-21.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:11.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:9.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[176]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{(S,P)} & \\text{mu} & \\text{deg P\\_k} & \\text{all four solve untwisted Baxter?}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,4,5\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,3,5\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,1,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,3,4\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,5,6\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,4,6\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,4,5\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,3,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,5,6\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,4,6\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,2,1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,4,5\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,4,0,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,1,6,7\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,3,1,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,2,5,7\\right\\} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,2,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,3,4,7\\right… [latex truncated: 1513 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "68813071-0fbb-4cc0-a21a-14c32f384d79"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 8.2 First non-trivial order\n\nWith the leading order taken from the closed forms above there is nothing left to choose: `tc^(0) = tc0U[mu,S,P]`, and since at `eps=0` the four twists collide the four Baxter equations become one, so all four `q_k^(0)` equal the *same* untwisted solution — the lowest-degree one `P_1`, normalised to `P_1(u0)=1`. (The higher `P_2..P_4` cannot appear: they are the order-0 rotation, and it is now fixed rather than free.)\n\nOrder `eps^1` is then a **linear** system in the order-1 unknowns alone. No branches.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Order eps^1. The order-0 data is fully determined, so this is a plain linear solve.\n   NB: P1 from QsolveU is symbolic in theta1,theta2,h while PertSetup's equations already have\n   th substituted -- q0 must be substituted too, or the order-0 residual is silently nonzero\n   (invisible at the pseudovacuum, where P_1 = 1 carries no theta dependence). *)\nClearAll[Order1];\nOrder1[SS_, PP_, μ_] := Module[{st, Mh, P1, q0, lead0, r0, e1, u1, sol, x},\n   st = PertSetup[SS, PP, μ, 1];\n   Mh = st[\"Mh\"];\n   P1 = QsolveU[μ, SS, PP] /. th;\n   P1 = P1[[1]];\n   q0 = Together[P1/qpoly[P1, u0]];                 (* normalised: q0(u0) = 1 *)\n   lead0 = Join[\n      Thread[Table[pv[tc[i], 0], {i, 5}] -> (tc0U[μ, SS, PP] /. th)],\n      Flatten[Table[pv[qc[k, j], 0] -> If[j <= Length[q0] - 1, q0[[j + 1]], 0], {k, 4}, {j, Mh[[k]]}]]];\n   r0 = Union[Expand[Together[Flatten[st[\"eqs\"][[1]]] /. lead0]]];   (* must be {} or {0} *)\n   u1 = Table[pv[v, 1], {v, st[\"unk\"]}];\n   e1 = DeleteCases[Expand[Together[Flatten[st[\"eqs\"][[2]]] /. lead0]], 0];\n   sol = Solve[Thread[e1 == 0], u1];\n   <|\"M\" -> st[\"M\"], \"Mh\" -> Mh, \"q0\" -> q0, \"tc0\" -> (tc0U[μ, SS, PP] /. th),\n     \"order0 residual\" -> r0, \"#eqs\" -> Length[e1], \"#unknowns\" -> Length[u1],\n     \"#solutions\" -> Length[sol], \"sol\" -> sol, \"lead0\" -> lead0,\n     \"linear?\" -> AllTrue[e1, Max[Exponent[#, u1]] <= 1 &],\n     \"free at order 1\" -> If[sol === {}, $Failed, Complement[u1, First[sol][[All, 1]]]]|>];\n\nord1vac = Order1[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\nKeyDrop[ord1vac, {\"sol\", \"lead0\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre-wrap\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
