667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">pv</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">tc</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">pv</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">tc</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[192]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{M}\\to \\left\\{0,0,2,2\\right\\},\\text{Mh}\\to \\left\\{0,1,4,5\\right\\},\\text{q0}\\to \\left\\{1\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{tc0}\\to \\left\\{\\frac{22}{7},\\frac{7214}{147},-\\frac{4472}{147},\\frac{3812}{441},\\frac{274}{21}\\right\\} \\\\\n  &,\\text{order0 residual}\\to \\left\\{0\\right\\},\\text{\\#eqs}\\to 30 \\\\\n  &,\\text{\\#unknowns}\\to 15,\\text{\\#solutions}\\to 1 \\\\\n  &,\\text{linear?}\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{free at order 1}\\to \\\\\n  &\\left\\{\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{qc}\\left(2,1\\right),1\\right),\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{qc}\\left(3,1\\right),1\\right),\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{qc}\\left(3,2\\right),1\\right),\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{qc}\\left(4,1\\right),1\\right) \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{qc}\\left(4,3\\right),1\\right),\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{qc}\\left(4,4\\right),1\\right) \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{tc}\\left(1\\right),1\\right),\\mathrm{pv}\\left(\\mathrm{tc}\\left(2\\right),1\\right)\\right\\}\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "cde08dbc-f3bf-454b-893c-7f1625b65d69"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<span style=\"display:none\"></span>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
       "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.error"
      }
     ],
     "id": "be27e7a8-0b74-44c2-bc72-ad8c22e03cda"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Validation. At the pseudovacuum tau is known in closed form (tau_vac), so tc(eps) is exact\n   for any twist. Expand it to first order in eps with z_j = Exp[I eps psi_j] and check it is\n   consistent with the order-1 relations found above -- i.e. that the two undetermined\n   directions tc[1]^(1), tc[2]^(1) are a genuine deficiency of THIS order, not an error. *)\nModule[{x, eqs, tcEps, tc1ex, rel},\n  eqs = Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Expand[τ[a][1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][x] - τvac[1, 1][a][x]], x], {a, 3}]];\n  tcEps = (tcvars /. First@Solve[Thread[eqs == 0], tcvars]) /. th /. zser[1];\n  tc1ex = Table[Coefficient[Series[tcEps[[i]], {eps, 0, 1}] // Normal, eps, 1], {i, 5}];\n  rel = First[ord1vac[\"sol\"]] /. {pv[tc[1], 1] -> tc1ex[[1]], pv[tc[2], 1] -> tc1ex[[2]]};\n  {\"exact tc^(0)\" -> Table[Coefficient[Series[tcEps[[i]], {eps, 0, 1}] // Normal, eps, 0], {i, 5}],\n   \"matches tc0U\" -> Simplify[Table[Coefficient[Series[tcEps[[i]], {eps, 0, 1}] // Normal, eps, 0], {i, 5}] - ord1vac[\"tc0\"]],\n   \"exact tc^(1)\" -> tc1ex,\n   \"order-1 relations satisfied\" -> Simplify[Table[pv[tc[i], 1], {i, 3, 5}] /. rel] - tc1ex[[3 ;; 5]]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
