       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.\nSolve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.\nJoin::heads: Heads Rule and List at positions 1 and 2 are expected to be the same.\nReplaceAll::reps: {Join[pv[tc[1], 0] -> --, {}]} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.                                         7\nReplaceAll::reps: {Join[pv[tc[1], 0] -> --, {}]} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.                                         7\nJoin::heads: Heads Rule and List at positions 1 and 2 are expected to be the same.\nReplaceAll::reps: {Join[-- -> --, {}]} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.                         7     7\nGeneral::stop: Further output of ReplaceAll::reps will be suppressed during this calculation.\nJoin::heads: Heads Rule and List at positions 1 and 2 are expected to be the same.\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Join::heads will be suppressed during this calculation.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\\nSolve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\\nJoin::heads: Heads Rule and List at positions 1 and 2 are expected to be the same.\\nReplaceAll::reps: {Join[pv[tc[1], 0] -> --, {}]} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.                                         7\\nReplaceAll::reps: {Join[pv[tc[1], 0] -> --, {}]} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.                                         7\\nJoin::heads: Heads Rule and List at positions 1 and 2 are expected to be the same.\\nReplaceAll::reps: {Join[-- -> --, {}]} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.                         7     7\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of ReplaceAll::reps will be suppressed during this calculation.\\nJoin::heads: Heads Rule and List at positions 1 and 2 are expected to be the same.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of Join::heads will be suppressed during this calculation.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
