  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Expand the exact twisted solution in eps and compare with the perturbative family. *)\nexactSer = Table[Table[Normal[Series[Together[exactMhat[[k, 2, j]] /. zser[2]], {eps, 0, 2}]],\n     {j, Length[exactMhat[[k, 2]]]}], {k, 4}];\nexactRule[n_] := Flatten[Table[pv[qc[k, j], n] -> Coefficient[exactSer[[k, j]], eps, n],\n     {k, 4}, {j, Length[exactSer[[k]]]}]];\n\n{\"exact q order 0 (should match lead0)\" ->\n   Simplify[(Table[pv[qc[k, j], 0], {k, 4}, {j, ord1vac[\"Mh\"][[k]]}] // Flatten) /. exactRule[0]],\n \"exact order-1 rotations\" -> (ord2vac[\"f1\"] /. exactRule[1] /. Thread[Table[pv[tc[i], 1], {i, 5}] -> tcExactSeries[[2]]]),\n \"perturbative branch 1 contains it?\" ->\n   Simplify[(ord2vac[\"f1\"] /. sol2vac[[1]] /. exactRule[1] /. Thread[Table[pv[tc[i], 1], {i, 5}] -> tcExactSeries[[2]]])\n          - (ord2vac[\"f1\"] /. exactRule[1] /. Thread[Table[pv[tc[i], 1], {i, 5}] -> tcExactSeries[[2]]])],\n \"perturbative branch 2 contains it?\" ->\n   Simplify[(ord2vac[\"f1\"] /. sol2vac[[2]] /. exactRule[1] /. Thread[Table[pv[tc[i], 1], {i, 5}] -> tcExactSeries[[2]]])\n          - (ord2vac[\"f1\"] /. exactRule[1] /. Thread[Table[pv[tc[i], 1], {i, 5}] -> tcExactSeries[[2]]])]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
