   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Multi-exponential ansatz\n\nSection 8 works branch by branch on `Q_k = Exp[phi_k u] q_k`, one polynomial each. The limit `eps -> 0` degenerates there: all four `q_k^(0)` collapse onto `P_1`.\n\nHere instead `Q` is a combination of several twisted exponentials,\n\n`Q(u) = Sum_j Exp[phi_j u] p_j(u)`,\n\napplied to the **original, undivided** Baxter equation. The point is that a difference of exponentials costs one power of `eps` and buys one power of `u`: `Exp[phi_2 u] - Exp[phi_1 u] ~ eps (psi_2 - psi_1) u`. So the extra degrees in the untwisted limit come from the exponentials, and the polynomial degrees stay bounded by the true `M_j` — which is exactly the mechanism behind `Mhat_k = M_k + (k-1)`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* The undivided Baxter operator. Section 8's BaxRes is this operator applied to a single\n   Exp[phi_k u] q_k, with the exponential stripped; here nothing is stripped.\n   Z[j] stands for z[j]^(u/h), so a shift u -> u + a h sends Z[j] -> z[j]^a Z[j]. *)\nClearAll[BaxOp, Zsh];\nZsh[a_, pj_][uu_] := Sum[Z[j] z[j]^a pj[[j]][uu + a h], {j, 4}];   (* Q(u + a h) *)\n\nBaxOp[SS_, PP_, μ_][pj_][uu_] :=\n     Product[ν1[SS, PP][uu - m h], {m, 0, 3}] Zsh[1, pj][uu]\n   - τ[1][SS, PP, μ][uu] Product[ν1[SS, PP][uu - m h], {m, 1, 3}] Zsh[0, pj][uu]\n   + τ[2][SS, PP, μ][uu] Product[ν1[SS, PP][uu - m h], {m, 2, 3}] Zsh[-1, pj][uu]\n   - τ[3][SS, PP, μ][uu] ν1[SS, PP][uu - 3 h] Zsh[-2, pj][uu]\n   + τ[4][SS, PP, μ][uu] Zsh[-3, pj][uu];\n\n(* Does the ansatz couple the p_j, or does it split? Apply BaxOp to four INDEPENDENT arbitrary\n   polynomials and read off the coefficient of each Z[j]. *)\nModule[{x, pj, res, split},\n  pj = Table[Function[y, Evaluate[Sum[pc[j, m] y^m, {m, 0, 2}]]], {j, 4}];\n  res = Expand[BaxOp[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][pj][x]];\n  split = Table[Simplify[Coefficient[res, Z[j]] - z[j]^-3 BaxRes[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][j][pj[[j]]][x]], {j, 4}];\n  {\"Z[j] coefficient == z_j^-3 BaxRes_j ?\" -> split,\n   \"any cross terms p_i in the Z[j] equation?\" ->\n     Table[Select[Table[i, {i, 4}], ! FreeQ[Coefficient[res, Z[j]], pc[i, _]] &], {j, 4}]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961315\" data-output-id=\"31\" data-out-n=\"219\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"57\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[219]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.01em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.755em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.755em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Z[j] coefficient == z_j</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-3 BaxRes_j ?</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.905em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">any cross terms p_i in the Z[j] equation?</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.905em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
