  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Triangular combinations. For each k, choose scalars a_j (j <= k, a_k = 1) so that\n      C_k(u) = Sum_{j<=k} a_j Exp[phi_j u] q_j(u)\n   vanishes to order eps^(k-1); the limit of C_k/eps^(k-1) then solves the UNTWISTED Baxter\n   equation. Degree count: the exponential supplies (k-1) powers of u on top of q_k's own M_k,\n   so the limit should have degree M_k + (k-1) = Mhat_k, and be P_k modulo lower P's.\n   Pseudovacuum (1,1), mu={2,2,0,0}: M = {0,0,2,2}, Mhat = {0,1,4,5}.\n   NB: the spectral variable is passed IN, not Module-localised -- a scoped x$nnn leaks into\n   the returned expression and downstream CoefficientList then reads every coefficient as\n   degree 0 (the Section 6 trap). *)\nClearAll[FF, combK];\nNN = 8;\nFF[j_][uu_] := Exp[I eps psi[[j]] uu] (1 + Sum[exactMhat[[j, 2, m]] uu^m, {m, Length[exactMhat[[j, 2]]]}] /. zser[NN]);\n\ncombK[k_, x_] := Module[{aa, expr, conds, sol, lim},\n   aa = Append[Table[av[j], {j, k - 1}], 1];\n   expr = Sum[aa[[j]] FF[j][x], {j, k}];\n   conds = Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Simplify[SeriesCoefficient[expr, {eps, 0, n}]], x], {n, 0, k - 2}]];\n   sol = If[k == 1, {}, First@Solve[Thread[conds == 0], Table[av[j], {j, k - 1}]]];\n   lim = Simplify[SeriesCoefficient[expr /. sol, {eps, 0, k - 1}]];\n   {k, aa /. sol, Exponent[Expand[lim], x], Collect[Expand[lim], x]}];\n\ncombs = Table[combK[k, uu], {k, 4}];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{combs[[k, 1]], combs[[k, 3]], Mdeg[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][[k]] + (k - 1), Collect[combs[[k, 4]], uu]}, {k, 4}],\n  {\"k\", \"degree of limit\", \"Mhat_k\", \"limit\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961315\" data-output-id=\"33\" data-out-n=\"231\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"58\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[231]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.0881em;vertical-align:-2.7741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.3141em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.2741em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2741em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.0481em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.7741em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2741em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.5859em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7741em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.0481em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.7741em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2741em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">degree of limit</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.5859em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7741em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.0481em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.7741em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2741em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mhat_k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.5859em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7741em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.0481em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.7741em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2741em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.4341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">limit</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2341em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8615em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">uu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">64715</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mt