  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Allow the coefficients to be LAURENT in eps: a_j = Sum_{n=-Np..0} av[j,n] eps^n.\n   Question: what is the minimal pole order Np for which\n      Sum_j a_j Exp[phi_j u] q_j(u)  =  P_k(u) + O(eps)\n   is solvable, i.e. how many 1/phi orders are needed to reach the untwisted solution P_k?\n   Regularity (vanishing of every negative-order coefficient) is imposed as part of the system. *)\nClearAll[reach];\nreach[k_, Np_, x_] := Module[{aj, expr, target, conds, unk, sol},\n   aj = Table[Sum[av[j, n] eps^n, {n, -Np, 0}], {j, 4}];\n   expr = Sum[aj[[j]] FF[j][x], {j, 4}];\n   target = qpoly[QsolveU[{2, 2, 0, 0}, 1, 1][[k]] /. th, x];\n   conds = Join[\n     Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Simplify[SeriesCoefficient[expr, {eps, 0, n}]], x], {n, -Np, -1}]],\n     CoefficientList[Simplify[SeriesCoefficient[expr, {eps, 0, 0}] - target], x]];\n   unk = Flatten[Table[av[j, n], {j, 4}, {n, -Np, 0}]];\n   sol = Quiet@Solve[Thread[conds == 0], unk];\n   sol =!= {}];\n\nGrid[Prepend[\n  Table[Prepend[Table[reach[k, Np, uu], {Np, 0, 3}], \"P_\" <> ToString[k] <> \" (deg \" <> ToString[degU[{2,2,0,0},1,1][[k]]] <> \")\"], {k, 4}],\n  {\"target\", \"Np=0\", \"Np=1\", \"Np=2\", \"Np=3\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961315\" data-output-id=\"34\" data-out-n=\"234\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"59\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[234]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">target</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P_1 (deg 0)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P_2 (deg 1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><sp