  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Deforming the untwisted solution\n\nStart from an untwisted solution `P_k` and switch the twist on order by order, working with the **undivided** Baxter operator and a plain polynomial `Q` — no exponential factored out.\n\nSince the exact solutions are `Exp[phi_j u] x polynomial`, the polynomial ansatz must gain one degree per order: `deg Q^(n) = deg P_k + n`. Finite at every order.\n\nEach order is **linear**: the order-`n` residual contains `tau^(n) Q^(0)` (unknown times known) and `tau^(0) Q^(n)` (known times unknown), while all mixed terms `tau^(m) Q^(n-m)`, `0 < m < n`, are already determined.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Undivided Baxter operator acting on a plain polynomial (no exponential stripped). *)\nClearAll[BaxU2, Push];\nBaxU2[SS_, PP_, μ_][Qf_][uu_] :=\n     Product[ν1[SS, PP][uu - m h], {m, 0, 3}] Qf[uu + h]\n   - τ[1][SS, PP, μ][uu] Product[ν1[SS, PP][uu - m h], {m, 1, 3}] Qf[uu]\n   + τ[2][SS, PP, μ][uu] Product[ν1[SS, PP][uu - m h], {m, 2, 3}] Qf[uu - h]\n   - τ[3][SS, PP, μ][uu] ν1[SS, PP][uu - 3 h] Qf[uu - 2 h]\n   + τ[4][SS, PP, μ][uu] Qf[uu - 3 h];\n\n(* Push the untwisted solution P_k to order eps^N. Returns the graded equations and unknowns;\n   solving is done in the next cell so the structure can be inspected first. *)\nPush[SS_, PP_, μ_, k_, N_, x_] := Module[{Mh, dn, P, Qf, tcser, R, eqs, unk},\n   Mh = degU[μ, SS, PP];\n   P = QsolveU[μ, SS, PP][[k]] /. th;\n   dn = Table[Mh[[k]] + n, {n, 0, N}];\n   Qf = Function[y, Evaluate[qpoly[P, y] + Sum[eps^n Sum[qq[n, m] y^m, {m, 0, dn[[n + 1]]}], {n, N}]]];\n   tcser = Table[tc[i] -> (tc0U[μ, SS, PP][[i]] /. th) + Sum[eps^n tcn[i, n], {n, N}], {i, 5}];\n   R = Expand[((BaxU2[SS, PP, μ][Qf][x] /. th) /. zser[N]) /. tcser];\n   eqs = Table[DeleteCases[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R, eps, n], x], 0], {n, 0, N}];\n   unk = Table[Join[Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}], Table[qq[n, m], {m, 0, dn[[n + 1]]}]], {n, N}];\n   <|\"P\" -> P, \"deg\" -> dn, \"eqs\" -> eqs, \"unk\" -> unk|>];\n\n(* Validation target: for k=1 at the pseudovacuum, q_1 = 1 exactly, so the true solution is\n   simply Q = Exp[I eps psi_1 u] -- known in closed form to all orders. *)\npush1 = Push[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 1, 3, uu];\n{\"P_1\" -> push1[\"P\"], \"degrees per order\" -> push1[\"deg\"],\n \"order-0 residual\" -> Union[push1[\"eqs\"][[1]]],\n \"#eqs per order\" -> Length /@ push1[\"eqs\"],\n \"#unknowns per order\" -> Length /@ push1[\"unk\"]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961315\" data-output-id=\"35\" data-out-n=\"239\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"61\" data-sub-start=\"25\" data-sub-end=\"28\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[239]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.51em;vertical-align:-2.005em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.505em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.505em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.505em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.005em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.505em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P_1</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">degrees per order</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.155em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order-0 residual</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">#eqs per order</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">#unknowns per order</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.005em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[239]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{P\\_1}\\to \\left\\{1\\right\\},\\text{degrees per order}\\to \\left\\{0,1,2,3\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{order-0 residual}\\to \\{\\},\\text{\\#eqs per order} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{0,7,8,9\\right\\},\\text{\\#unknowns per order}\\to \\left\\{7,8,9\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a888f530-8898-4d14-9bd9-5d3b9a774d86"
    }
