  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Solve order by order. At each order the only gauge freedom is adding a multiple of a\n   lower untwisted solution; the normalisation Q(u0)=1 removes the constant one, which is all\n   there is here since deg Q^(n) = n and the untwisted solutions have degrees {0,1,4,5}. *)\nClearAll[PushSolve];\nPushSolve[st_, N_] := Module[{acc = {}, sol, e, u},\n   Do[e = DeleteCases[Expand[st[\"eqs\"][[n + 1]] /. acc], 0];\n      u = st[\"unk\"][[n]];\n      sol = Solve[Join[Thread[e == 0], {qq[n, 0] == 0}], u];   (* Q^(n)(0) = 0 *)\n      If[sol === {}, Return[<|\"order\" -> n, \"status\" -> \"inconsistent\"|>]];\n      acc = Join[acc, First[sol]], {n, N}];\n   acc];\n\npushSol1 = PushSolve[push1, 3];\n\n(* Exact answer for this branch: q_1 = 1, so Q = Exp[I eps psi_1 u] with psi_1 = 1. *)\nexactPush = Table[SeriesCoefficient[Exp[I eps psi[[1]] uu], {eps, 0, n}], {n, 0, 3}];\nrecon = Table[Sum[qq[n, m] uu^m, {m, 0, n}] /. pushSol1, {n, 3}];\n\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{n, Simplify[recon[[n]]], exactPush[[n + 1]], Simplify[recon[[n]] - exactPush[[n + 1]]]}, {n, 3}],\n  {\"n\", \"Q^(n) from solver\", \"exact\", \"difference\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of Solve::svars will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
