     "id": "e491d134-d739-4acc-921b-aeba7c32d57c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10.2 All four branches at once\n\nThe fix is to impose the exponential form on **all four branches simultaneously, sharing one tau**:\n\n`Q_k(u) = Exp[phi_k u] p_k(u)`,  `deg p_k = M_k`,  `p_k(u0) = 1`,  `p_k^(0) = P_1` normalised (same for every `k`).\n\nDegree bound `M_k`, not `Mhat_k` — Section 8 showed the extra coefficients vanish identically. All orders up to `N` are solved together, so the one-order lag (order `n` equations fixing tau at order `n-1`) resolves itself instead of needing a separate secular step.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Joint solver: four branches, one shared tau, exponential ansatz, expanded from the\n   untwisted solution P_1. All orders 1..N solved simultaneously. *)\nClearAll[JointSolve];\nJointSolve[SS_, PP_, μ_, N_, x_] := Module[{Mk, P1, q0, pfun, tcser, pcser, R, eqs, unk, sol},\n   Mk = Mdeg[SS, PP, μ];\n   P1 = QsolveU[μ, SS, PP] /. th; P1 = P1[[1]];\n   q0 = Together[P1/qpoly[P1, u0]];\n   pcser[k_, j_] := If[j <= Length[q0] - 1, q0[[j + 1]], 0] + Sum[eps^n pcn[k, j, n], {n, N}];\n   tcser = Table[tc[i] -> (tc0U[μ, SS, PP][[i]] /. th) + Sum[eps^n tcn[i, n], {n, N}], {i, 5}];\n   pfun[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[1 + Sum[pcser[k, j] y^j, {j, Mk[[k]]}]]];\n   R = Table[Expand[((BaxRes[SS, PP, μ][k][pfun[k]][x] /. th) /. zser[N]) /. tcser], {k, 4}];\n   eqs = DeleteCases[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R[[k]], eps, n], x], {k, 4}, {n, 0, N}]], 0];\n   unk = Join[Flatten[Table[tcn[i, n], {n, N}, {i, 5}]], Flatten[Table[pcn[k, j, n], {n, N}, {k, 4}, {j, Mk[[k]]}]]];\n   sol = Solve[Thread[eqs == 0], unk];\n   <|\"M\" -> Mk, \"q0\" -> q0, \"#eqs\" -> Length[eqs], \"#unk\" -> Length[unk],\n     \"#sol\" -> Length[sol], \"sol\" -> sol, \"unk\" -> unk,\n     \"free\" -> If[sol === {}, $Failed, Complement[unk, First[sol][[All, 1]]]]|>];\n\njoint2 = JointSolve[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 2, uu];\nKeyDrop[joint2, {\"sol\", \"unk\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">2 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
