  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* One more order: tau at order n should be fully determined once the equations at order n+1\n   are included. Validate every determined order against the exact pseudovacuum tau. *)\njoint3 = JointSolve[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 3, uu];\n\nGrid[Prepend[\n  Table[{n, Simplify[(Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}] /. First[joint3[\"sol\"]]) - tcExact3[[n]]]}, {n, 2}],\n  {\"order n\", \"tc^(n) from joint solver  -  exact\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
