  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Validate the branch polynomials themselves against the exact twisted q_k of Section 8.5,\n   order by order in eps (only the orders that came out determined). *)\nexactPc[k_, j_, n_] := Coefficient[Normal[Series[Together[exactMhat[[k, 2, j]] /. zser[4]], {eps, 0, 3}]], eps, n];\nMk = Mdeg[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\n\nGrid[Prepend[\n  Table[{k, n, Simplify[Table[pcn[k, j, n] /. First[joint3[\"sol\"]], {j, Mk[[k]]}] - Table[exactPc[k, j, n], {j, Mk[[k]]}]]},\n    {k, 4}, {n, 2}] // Flatten[#, 1] &,\n  {\"k\", \"order n\", \"p_k^(n) coefficients  -  exact\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
