  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* State D, (S,P)=(3,1), mu={3,3,1,1}. No closed form here, so cross-check against Section 8:\n   the joint solver's tc^(1) must satisfy Section 8's order-1 relations (which expressed\n   tc[3],tc[4],tc[5] in terms of the then-free tc[1],tc[2]). *)\njointD = JointSolve[3, 1, {3, 3, 1, 1}, 2, uu];\ntcD1 = Simplify[Table[tcn[i, 1], {i, 5}] /. First[jointD[\"sol\"]]];\n\n{\"M\" -> jointD[\"M\"], \"#eqs/#unk/#sol\" -> {jointD[\"#eqs\"], jointD[\"#unk\"], jointD[\"#sol\"]},\n \"free\" -> jointD[\"free\"],\n \"tc^(1)\" -> tcD1,\n \"satisfies Section 8 order-1 relations?\" ->\n   Simplify[(Table[pv[tc[i], 1], {i, 3, 5}] /. First[ord1D[\"sol\"]] /. {pv[tc[1], 1] -> tcD1[[1]], pv[tc[2], 1] -> tcD1[[2]]}) - tcD1[[3 ;; 5]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
